    "objective": "51 to win. Card points 3/2/A=â…“ each, Re/Cavallo/Fante=â…“, 7-4=0. Last trick +1. Buongiochi: 4Ã—3/2/A=4, 3Ã—3/2/A=3, Napoletana(3-2-A suit)=3.",
